sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Admin or Member
    participant UI as React App
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant CW as Camera Worker
    participant CAM as Camera
    participant DT as YOLO Detector
    participant AE as Alert Engine
    participant DB as SQLite

    A->>UI: Press Start on camera
    UI->>API: POST /cameras/{id}/start
    API->>CW: Start worker thread
    API->>DB: Mark camera active
    API-->>UI: Camera status
    loop Every 1 second
        CW->>CAM: Read frame
        CAM-->>CW: Frame
        CW->>DT: detect(frame)
        DT-->>CW: Detections
        CW->>DB: Save detections
    end
    loop Every 60 seconds
        CW->>AE: evaluate_camera()
        AE->>DB: Count detections in time window
        AE->>DB: Create alert if rule is breached
    end
    A->>UI: Open Alerts page
    UI->>API: GET /workspaces/{id}/alerts
    API-->>UI: Open alerts
    A->>UI: Acknowledge alert
    UI->>API: POST /alerts/{id}/acknowledge
    API->>DB: Status acknowledged
